      <p>The <strong>iShares Core Dividend Growth ETF (DGRO)</strong> is one of the most popular dividend growth ETFs in the United States, with over $30 billion in assets under management. It tracks the <em>Morningstar US Dividend Growth Index</em>, which selects U.S. stocks that have a history of consistently growing dividends, screened for payout ratio sustainability (payout ratio under 75%) and at least five consecutive years of dividend growth.</p>
